    {
      "id": "dev-same-reading-loop-in-legal:seg:0",
      "text": "Larkspur Health. They're ready to sign, pending their privacy review."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-same-reading-loop-in-legal:seg:1",
      "text": "Their privacy officer sent our data processing agreement back with comments. Mostly about subprocessors."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-same-reading-loop-in-legal:seg:2",
      "text": "We added two subprocessors last quarter, so the list in the DPA is out of date."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-same-reading-loop-in-legal:seg:3",
      "text": "Can we just update the list?"
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-same-reading-loop-in-legal:seg:4",
      "text": "We can. But they also want breach notice within 48 hours instead of 72. That's a legal call, not ours."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-same-reading-loop-in-legal:seg:5",
      "text": "OK. Chiara, can you loop in legal before Friday?"
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-same-reading-loop-in-legal:seg:6",
      "text": "Yep, I'll loop in legal today."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-same-reading-loop-in-legal:seg:7",
      "text": "I'll send you the updated subprocessor list so it all goes over together."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-same-reading-loop-in-legal:seg:8",
      "text": "Thanks, that saves a round trip."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-same-reading-loop-in-legal:seg:9",
      "text": "What's the timeline on their side?"
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-same-reading-loop-in-legal:seg:10",
      "text": "Their board signs off on new vendors on the 6th."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-same-reading-loop-in-legal:seg:11",
      "text": "Fine. If legal is OK with 48 hours, we're done."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-same-reading-loop-in-legal:seg:12",
      "text": "And if they're not?"
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-same-reading-loop-in-legal:seg:13",
      "text": "Then I'll call their privacy officer myself and find a middle ground."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-same-reading-loop-in-legal:seg:14",
      "text": "Makes sense."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-same-reading-loop-in-legal:seg:15",
      "text": "Should I also update the public subprocessor page?"
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-same-reading-loop-in-legal:seg:16",
      "text": "Yes, same day as the DPA list, so they match."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-same-reading-loop-in-legal:seg:17",
      "text": "Will do."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-same-reading-loop-in-legal:seg:18",
      "text": "Great. Thanks, everyone."
    }
  ],
